{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">九龍城有供電設備故障，多幢大廈停電。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">窩打老道一帶部分大廈漆黑一片，無冷氣亦無風扇，電梯暫停運作。有長者不適由救護車送院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-0430_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kEzN94xRlS1790804849.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-0430_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中電派工程車到場，工作人員進行搶修，鋪設臨時電纜；又調動臨時發動機，為受影響院舍及樓宇提供流動電池作應急支援。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-0430_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jibkrfCMw11790804847.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ELECTRICITY-0430_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中電表示，昨晚約11時位於窩打老道附近有供電設備出現故障，影響約1,000名客戶的電力供應。附近的維景酒店也受影響，部分住客在大堂等候，有住客表示酷熱難耐。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T22:40:14.061419+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}